    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Fully renovated property to a very high standard\n•Spacious property on approx. 1.9 acres\n•Available furnished, partially furnished or fully furnished\n•Electric gates with intercom and camera\n•Gardener will maintain the gardens\n\nStunning, fully renovated property on approx. 1.9 acres with detached garage. This beautiful home which is currently unfurnished can be let partially furnished or fully furnished also. Please note the furnished rooms in the photos are digitally staged and this would not be the furniture supplied. Available immediately.\n\nThe property which is set in a beautiful location has new windows, kitchen, bathrooms, flooring and it is newly painted. Consists of sitting room to the front of the house with fireplace, very large kitchen overlooking the rear garden leading to a large living room with space for dining, a wood burning stove and doors to the rear garden with patio, utility room, guest w.c., there are 3 double bedrooms downstairs, one with en suite, the bedrooms could be used as an office/ playroom etc, main bathroom, upstairs there are two large double bedrooms both with en suite and one with a walk in wardrobe. Located in a delightful rural setting just 10 km from Maynooth and 7 km from the M4 motorway. Plenty of parking, plus oil fired heating and alarmed."
      },
